      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://smp.assoma.com/ko/shop/lined-chemical-pump-5/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;부식성 및 위험 화학물질을 위한 설계된 펌핑 솔루션 
    &lt;div id=&#34;부식성-및-위험-화학물질을-위한-설계된-펌핑-솔루션&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
